    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nI cannot explain it well, so please refer to the steps to reproduce below.\n\nThis bisects to 64a301184ef39a0653c99c8edc1b63cd3fd16236 (#41297).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```\nseq 3 | nvim --clean -\n```\n\n1. `<C-V>jI1<ESC>`\n```\n11\n12\n3\n```\n\n2. `j.` (expected)\n```\n11\n112\n13\n```\n\n3. `j.`&mdash;blockwise Visual mode unexpectedly starts\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\n```\n11\n112\n113\n```\nis obtained, and nvim stays in normal mode.\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\n8782c70127c13893a1aa16b64404ae31e75dd12c\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nno, vim 9.2.1046\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nEndeavourOS\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nghostty 1.3.1\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nxterm-ghostty\n\n### Installation\n\nbuild from repo",
